  "title": "Custom Floral Cross Bible Verse Blanket, Machine Washable - D13",
  "handle": "custom-floral-cross-bible-verse-blanket-machine-washable-d13",
  "body_html": "<p>Immerse yourself in faith and comfort with our Jeminise Bible Verse Blanket. This personalized Christian blanket is crafted to surround you with warmth, peace, and daily encouragement, making it a truly heartfelt keepsake or an inspirational gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Blends soft, skin-friendly fleece with uplifting scripture and verses, perfect for prayer and quiet reflection.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized with Love:</strong> Add a name or date to create a one-of-a-kind blanket, celebrating faith and cherished inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made with skin-friendly fabric, providing warmth and comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Gift:</strong> An ideal religious throw blanket for women and girls, perfect for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and maintains fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Recommended for indoor use and suitable for all seasons.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>S/M/L/XL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
